OL,3,GNEWSAEco-park emphasises future of
OL,4,Aregeneration in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landmark urban farm and eco-park,
OL,7,Fwhich has been under development for
OL,8,Ffive years, will open its welcome
OL,9,Fcentre on Saturday.
OL,11,FThe #13m Northern Roots project, built
OL,12,Fon 160 acres of disused industrial land
OL,13,Fto the south of Alexandra Park in
OL,14,FOldham, is set to become the largest
OL,15,Furban farm and eco-park in the UK
OL,16,Fwithin the next four years.
OL,18,FThe site is home to community gardens,
OL,19,Falong with an events arena and a
OL,20,Fbuilding for teaching forestry skills.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
